<title>USA: Great American BackRub files offering.</title>
<headline>Great American BackRub files offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great American BackRub Store Inc filed with regulators to offer two million redeemable warrants and up to 16,144,814 common shares and two million shares of Series B convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>The registration statement was filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
